<title>INDIA: CRICKET-India cricketers return after African tour.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-India cricketers return after African tour.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indian cricket team returned home early on Tuesday after a losing tour of South Africa and Zimbabwe.</p>
<p>The team lost two of the three test matches it played in South Africa. It was unsuccessful in the one-day arena as well, losing the final of the triangular series to South Africa. The third side in the tournament was Zimbabwe.</p>
<p>The Indians were also beaten by their hosts in a one-day series played in Zimbabwe.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
